# HARDKOR Diet FAQ PDF

Standalone FAQ PDF — **not** part of the 7-page HARDKOR Diet. Linked from purchase email (exact copy from user only).

**Visual style:** modern B&B report frame; Food Plan page is the design reference. See `.cursor/rules/modern-pdf-style.mdc`.

## Naming (locked)

| Layer | Name | Example |
|-------|------|---------|
| **Product** (user-facing) | **The HARDKOR Diet FAQ** | Email, contact, page title |
| **Download filename** | `HARDKOR-Diet-FAQ.pdf` | `Content-Disposition` attachment |
| **Repo static file** | `docs/samples/hardkor-diet-faq.pdf` | Commit after `npm run render:hardkor-diet-faq` |
| **API slug** | `hardkor-diet-faq` | `GET /api/samples/hardkor-diet-faq` |
| **npm script** | `render:hardkor-diet-faq` | Regenerates repo static file |

Constants: `js/faqPdfNamingHelpers.js` — single source for product name, filename, repo file, slug.

Legacy slug `burn-and-build-faq` redirects on the API (email bookmarks only).

## Download URL (after push to `main`)

```
https://program-creator-3tzd.onrender.com/api/samples/hardkor-diet-faq
```

Inline preview: same URL with `?inline=1`

## Code paths

| Piece | Path |
|-------|------|
| Q&A copy | `data/handbookFaqPrintout.js` |
| Payload | `js/handbookFaqPrintoutData.js` |
| Renderer | `server/pdf/renderHandbookFaqPrintout.js` |
| Page draw | `server/pdf/drawModernFaqPage.js` |
| Static file | `docs/samples/hardkor-diet-faq.pdf` |
| API route | `GET /api/samples/hardkor-diet-faq` (`server/samplePdfDownloads.js`) |
| Render script | `scripts/render-hardkor-diet-faq.mjs` |

Internal `handbookFaq*` module names are legacy code paths only — **product name is always The HARDKOR Diet FAQ**.

## Verify

```
npm run verify:pdf
npm run render:hardkor-diet-faq
npm run verify:hardkor-asset-slugs
```

Commit `docs/samples/hardkor-diet-faq.pdf`, push to `main`, then share the API URL. Never use `/opt/cursor/artifacts/` for user downloads.
